# Striker: the meter swings, a key strikes; the test player strikes as it passes the target. Level 1 (bands) played
# on the mark: a high score and the best kept; a practice strike standing; level 3 (uneven) played a mark high: fewer
# points, no new best; stopped with PLAY
wait 800
turn SELECT 10
wait 400
expect cab 10
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect game 11
expect striker_state 0
wait 700
shot stand.png
tapkey 9
wait 120
shot practice_strike.png
wait 1500
expect striker_state 0
expect striker_n 0
autostriker on
tap PLAY
wait 150
expect striker_state 1
shot ready.png
wait 1800
shot flight.png
wait 13880
shot bell.png
wait 26120
expect striker_state 4
expect striker_n 10
expect striker_exact 10
expect striker_rung 2
expect striker_score 110
expect striker_best 110
shot over.png
autostriker off
turn K1 2
wait 200
